ers.discarding());\\n+        assertThat(response.statusCode()).isEqualTo(200);\\n     }\\n \\n-    @SpringBootConfiguration(proxyBeanMethods = false)\\n-    @EnableAutoConfiguration\\n-    static class TestApplication {}\\n+    private static void removeContainer(String containerName) throws Exception {\\n+        Process removeCommand = new ProcessBuilder(\\\"docker\\\", \\\"rm\\\", \\\"-f\\\", containerName)\\n+                .redirectErrorStream(true)\\n+                .start();\\n+        if (!removeCommand.waitFor(IO_TIMEOUT.toSeconds(), TimeUnit.SECONDS)) {\\n+            removeCommand.destroyForcibly();\\n+            removeCommand.waitFor(IO_TIMEOUT.toSeconds(), TimeUnit.SECONDS);\\n+        }\\n+    }\\n }\\ndiff --git a/tests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/user-code-filter.json b/tests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/user-code-filter.json\\nindex 6d5c3574fe..a9068154ac 100644\\n--- a/tests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/user-code-filter.json\\n+++ b/tests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/user-code-filter.json\\n@@ -1,10 +1,13 @@\\n {\\n-  \\\"rules\\\": [\\n+  \\\"rules\\\" : [\\n     {\\n-      \\\"excludeClasses\\\": \\\"**\\\"\\n+      \\\"excludeClasses\\\" : \\\"**\\\"\\n     },\\n     {\\n-      \\\"includeClasses\\\": \\\"org.springframework.cloud.vault.config.**\\\"\\n+      \\\"includeClasses\\\" : \\\"org.springframework.cloud.vault.config.**\\\"\\n+    },\\n+    {\\n+      \\\"includeClasses\\\" : \\\"org_springframework_cloud.spring_cloud_vault_config.**\\\"\\n     }\\n   ]\\n }\\n\"}], \"isError\": false, \"timestamp\": 1788519474923}, {\"role\": \"toolResult\", \"toolCallId\": \"call_t6uo3OwwM6INMAp4y0dXxoJw|fc_0f1e6303fe6b7493016a9aa4322f5887d2a5269b09d9b92f88\", \"toolName\": \"bash\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"metadata/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/reachability-metadata